"https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_4492847247619795_1715266363353349234_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xl3f06DOKOMQ7kNvwHT2FRz&_nc_oc=AdpJcVE19hVHRAHMpU7BoiY5qENHJkRk1tkpIoYIIoSMStRTIsuTU7hwdWzt22sXWTw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIn8SY1JSoGq41R2CCT0PGLjFJzhwFAjRCzKSL3m_KN4w&oe=6A997686"}, {"file_name": "Desktop 2026.04.15 - 15.07.00.02.00_00_26_34.Still004.png", "id": "1324653739563435", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819356_1324653742896768_8124727627985499011_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V90TLtCVmtoQ7kNvwHmxaTc&_nc_oc=AdrslgV6YNDjXIrrluRpsuqoKzvbBBEioOET40WPHU6h9C_ZPXCENZ7oR_Du-N9ulbo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJsnokP9YJQGS0ctI0DDPSlwRyHv_THzylWSdfQEPznaw&oe=6A9996D8"}, {"file_name": "Desktop 2026.04.15 - 15.07.00.02.00_00_36_19.Still006.png", "id": "3492865870860898", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823310_3492865874194231_678556541401456655_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=F1kU-50USlgQ7kNvwGGWAif&_nc_oc=AdpFvalqGPdGmvUxI7Uahokv4eYwDkCnb9tIgTwhWg-lo22luaFWk5PFZUgCnNu2Yhs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQImzY3xTGG_ewtTNPGgLjRj9XeyzmY1P8HF-pcopJHliw&oe=6A998DBA"}, {"file_name": "Desktop 2026.04.15 - 15.07.00.02.00_00_17_15.Still002.png", "id": "1652531472434679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_1652531479101345_6711251829141289676_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oXEiMvs2arwQ7kNvwFTUd07&_nc_oc=AdqIUeUjEgewz_gonw29D8Ue3EJacZqpCmQYUCqU65IvPGe7jfP7qFWFINltvg_258E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLychMDl4-Fx76wkOM5TR5qGbiUxCoCPgkm7YTNi6BOoQ&oe=6A999010"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art 2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1185396463569354", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818890_1185396466902687_3485502356355162100_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1iOnlKrLwPoQ7kNvwHD3rzm&_nc_oc=AdqzuNO8AMFB9yIbd7sCwXRpdg3dUVUfjLGgywaIwr_I5wykszvuxqQIbp2-3RaQ6AE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJuPTTcr43OKz6u54zAMI3vNdfL6g2e9DPz11kfre7VWA&oe=6A9976F2"}, "display_name": "Irusu Cricket VR", "keywords": ["Cricket", "Sports", "Batting", "T20", "Physics"], "long_description": "IRUSU CRICKET VR: THE ULTIMATE QUEST 3 EXPERIENCE\n\nStep onto the pitch with a true-to-life, physics-driven VR cricket simulation built exclusively for Meta Quest 3 and 3s.\n\nREAL BATTING PHYSICS\nExperience 1:1 VR bat tracking. The game calculates sweet spots and power directly from your actual swing. Controller haptics let you physically feel a clean drive versus a thick edge.\n\nSMART AI & REAL MATCHES\nFace 150 km/h bouncers and sharp spin from adaptive AI bowlers. Watch fielders dive for catches in real-time. Play 3, 5, 10, or 20-over matches complete with Power Plays and Super Overs.\n\nTV-STYLE DRS SYSTEM\nChallenge the umpire! Watch cinematic Hawk-Eye, Ultra-Edge (Snicko), and HotSpot reviews unfold on the stadium Jumbotron.\n\nGLOBAL STADIUMS & PROGRESSION\nMaster your swing in Net Practice, then conquer unique pitches in Mumbai, Melbourne, and London. Unlock premium gear, track your stats, and immerse yourself in dynamic crowd roars.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n- 1:1 physics-based batting\n- Adaptive AI bowling & active fielding\n- 3rd Umpire DRS (Hawk-Eye, Snicko, HotSpot)\n- Quick matches to full T20 formats\n- 3 iconic stadiums & Net Practice mode\n- Bat skins, career stats & haptic feedback\n- Feel every ball. Own every shot.", "short_description": "Step onto the crease. Face AI bowlers. Play VR cricket like never before."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.irusu.co.in/privacy-policy-2/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Irusu Studios", "support_website_url": 